  "description": "This is a card made accessible by the <a href=\"/cards/FeudalKingdom/33\">Engineer</a>. To discover it, you must first discard him and destroy a Lumberjack in play. The red arrows at the top of this card means that when you discover it, you must choose which of its 2 sides should be face up (the serial number must be at the top of this card, whichever side you choose). Choose wisely, since you cannot change this later.\n\nChoosing the Saw Mill will set you up with [wood] for a long time, and it might even flood you with inspiration for some construction work. Expanding your Wood Export, on the other hand, establishes a steady trade network, allowing you to adjust better to your most pressing needs at any given time. Choices, choices...",
